# PID 1 is busybox init (docs/linux-appliance.md, Init): rcS brings the machine up, samaltak-run is the VM (respawned
# when it ends, unless it asked for a power off or reboot), rcK takes it down on poweroff, reboot or Ctrl-Alt-Del.
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
::respawn:/sbin/samaltak-run
tty2::askfirst:-/bin/sh
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/etc/init.d/rcK
